ext-align:justify;\" data-flag=\"normal\">This is a dilemma faced by a lot of young people in modern society,</p><p style=\"color:#333333;font-weight:normal;font-size:16px;line-height:30px;font-family:Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;hyphens:auto;text-align:justify;\" data-flag=\"normal\">这是现代社会很多年轻人面临的困境</p><p style=\"color:#333333;font-weight:normal;font-size:16px;line-height:30px;font-family:Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;hyphens:auto;text-align:justify;\" data-flag=\"normal\">especially in post-capitalist society.</p><p style=\"color:#333333;font-weight:normal;font-size:16px;line-height:30px;font-family:Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;hyphens:auto;text-align:justify;\" data-flag=\"normal\">尤其是在后资本主义社会</p><p style=\"color:#333333;font-weight:normal;font-size:16px;line-height:30px;font-family:Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;hyphens:auto;text-align:justify;\" data-flag=\"normal\">The market offers you a tremendous amount of opportunities</p><p style=\"color:#333333;font-weight:normal;font-size:16px;line-height:30px;font-family:Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;hyphens:auto;text-align:justify;\" data-flag=\"normal\">市场为你提供了海量机会</p><p style=\"color:#333333;font-weight:normal;font-size:16px;line-height:30px;font-family:Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;hyphens:auto;text-align:justify;\" data-flag=\"normal\">At the same time you don't know who you are.</p><p style=\"color:#333333;font-weight:normal;font-size:16px;line-height:30px;font-family:Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;hyphens:auto;text-align:justify;\" data-flag=\"normal\">但同时你却不知道自己是谁</p><p style=\"color:#333333;font-weight:normal;font-size:16px;line-height:30px;font-family:Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;hyphens:auto;text-align:justify;\" data-flag=\"normal\">So I think a great way to make better decisions</p><p style=\"color:#333333;font-weight:normal;font-size:16px;line-height:30px;font-family:Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;hyphens:auto;text-align:justify;\" data-flag=\"normal\">我认为做出更好决策的好方法</p><p style=\"color:#333333;font-weight:normal;font-size:16px;lin